OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786906080
OL,3,CVan mounts pavement seriously injuring
OL,4,Ctwo people outside shop
OL,6,FTwo pedestrians have been seriously
OL,7,Fhurt, one sustaining potentially life-
OL,8,Fchanging injuries, in a collision in
OL,9,FSussex.
OL,11,FA white Mercedes Vito van mounted the
OL,12,Fpavement and struck a man and a woman
OL,13,Foutside a shop at about 1.30pm on
OL,14,FFriday 14th August.
OL,16,FBoth have been taken to hospital for
OL,17,Ftreatment with the woman suffering
OL,18,Fsevere injuries.
OL,20,FDamage was also caused to the shop
OL,21,Ffront on East Street, Rye.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
