PN,38602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786906080
OL,3,CVan mounts pavement seriously injuring
OL,4,Ctwo people outside shop
OL,6,FA 37-year-old man from Willesborough,
OL,7,FKent, was arrested at the scene on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of drug driving and causing
OL,9,Fserious injury by dangerous driving.
OL,11,FHe was taken to custody and later
OL,12,Freleased on bail pending further
OL,13,Fenquiries.
OL,15,FThe road was closed with the junction
OL,16,Fof the High Street to allow emergency
OL,17,Fservices to treat the casualties,
OL,18,Finvestigate the collision.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
