PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786906080
OL,3,CVan mounts pavement seriously injuring
OL,4,Ctwo people outside shop
OL,6,FPC Sam Bourne, of the Roads Policing
OL,7,FUnit, said: "The area was very busy at
OL,8,Fthe time of the collision, and we
OL,9,Fwould like to hear from anyone who
OL,10,Fwitnessed it or has any CCTV, dashcam
OL,11,For mobile phone footage of the
OL,12,Fcollision, which could help our
OL,13,Finvestigation.
OL,15,F"We would like to thank the local
OL,16,Fcommunity for their compassion towards
OL,17,Fthose involved and for their patience
OL,18,Fwhile emergency services dealt with
OL,19,Fthe incident."
